[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Provable System Requirements Specification

[SECTION]
TITLE: 1. PM Studio Frontend (React / Vite)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-PM-001
TITLE: Simplified Specification Explorer View
STATEMENT: The PM Studio shall display a streamlined Requirements Explorer as the primary navigation workspace, tracking requirement completion status (Backlog vs Done) without redundant Kanban board columns.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-PM-002
TITLE: Requirements Explorer Hierarchy Tree
STATEMENT: The PM Studio shall provide a hierarchical tree view supporting folders, requirements, tasks, and bugs with full CRUD operations, parent-child relationships, dependency linking, and agent role assignment.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-PM-003
TITLE: Coverage Hub & Embedded Allure Report Portal
STATEMENT: The PM Studio shall render aggregated test coverage metrics, requirement-to-test mapping tables, and embed the containerized Allure reporting portal (:5050) inside an iframe view.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-PM-004
TITLE: Code Review & Side-by-Side Diff Viewer
STATEMENT: The PM Studio shall render side-by-side git diffs for developer agent code submissions, display pytest assertion outputs, and provide one-click Approval (Merge to Main) and Rejection workflows.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-PM-005
TITLE: Agent Tray & Real-time Console Log Streaming
STATEMENT: The PM Studio shall feature a collapsible bottom Agent Tray displaying active execution nodes, current retry attempt counts, streaming log feeds, and pending review queue items.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: Med
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-PM-006
TITLE: Multi-Project Workspace Selector & Settings Modal
STATEMENT: The PM Studio shall allow selecting target projects/workspaces, configuring LLM model endpoints, and customizing integration tokens via a dedicated settings drawer.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: Med
STATUS: Backlog

[/SECTION]

[SECTION]
TITLE: 2. FastAPI Backend Engine

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-BE-001
TITLE: SQLite DataStore Storage Engine
STATEMENT: The backend shall manage all requirements, test cases, and agent execution runs using an SQLite database (`backend/provable.db`) managed via `backend/db/store.py`.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-BE-002
TITLE: Database Schema & Automated Triggers
STATEMENT: The SQLite database shall enforce relational foreign keys across `requirements`, `test_cases`, and `agent_runs` tables, with SQL triggers for `updated_at` timestamps.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-BE-003
TITLE: StrictDoc Real-time Bidirectional Sync
STATEMENT: The backend shall automatically parse `.sdoc` specification files into SQLite on startup and trigger `export_sdoc()` on database modifications to maintain repository file alignment.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-BE-004
TITLE: REST API Endpoints & State Management
STATEMENT: The FastAPI application (`backend/main.py`) shall expose REST endpoints for requirement CRUD, project selection, git diff generation, agent run statuses, and ticket merge approvals.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-BE-005
TITLE: Startup Allure Project Registration
STATEMENT: The backend startup lifecycle shall automatically register the `provable` project with the containerized Allure Docker Service on port `5050`.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: Med
STATUS: Backlog

[/SECTION]

[SECTION]
TITLE: 3. Agent Orchestration Engine (LangGraph)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-AG-001
TITLE: StateGraph Orchestration Machine
STATEMENT: The orchestrator shall manage autonomous developer agent loops using a LangGraph StateGraph state machine with configurable node transitions and retry state context.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-AG-002
TITLE: Isolated Git Branch Management (`prepare_branch`)
STATEMENT: The orchestrator shall isolate development on a dedicated git branch (`ticket/<TICKET_ID>`) created from `main`, resetting clean workspace state before code modification.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-AG-003
TITLE: Context-Aware Code Generation (`code_generation`)
STATEMENT: The agent shall load externalized prompt templates (`prompts/code_generation.md`), inject requirement specs, test assertion tracebacks, and prior attempt feedback to generate targeted code changes.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-AG-004
TITLE: Sandbox Pytest & Allure Upload (`test_runner`)
STATEMENT: The orchestrator shall launch preview dev servers, run pytest suites with `--alluredir`, parse assertion results, and post execution results to the Allure Docker container.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-AG-005
TITLE: Selenium & Gemini Vision Quality Gate (`visual_qa`)
STATEMENT: The orchestrator shall capture mobile (`375x812`) and desktop (`1280x800`) screenshots via headless Selenium and evaluate visual layout regressions using Gemini Vision.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-AG-006
TITLE: Retry Loops & Git Branch Rollback (`finalize`)
STATEMENT: Upon test or visual failure within `max_attempts` limits, the agent shall retry code generation with error context; upon reaching `max_attempts`, it shall perform a clean `git checkout -- .` and `git clean -fd` rollback.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-AG-007
TITLE: Code Review Submission & Branch Merge Finalization
STATEMENT: Upon successful verification, the orchestrator shall commit code to the ticket branch and update requirement status to `Review`. Upon PM approval, it shall merge the ticket branch into `main`.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[/SECTION]

[SECTION]
TITLE: 4. Integrations Layer

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-INT-001
TITLE: StrictDoc Integration Client
STATEMENT: The integration layer shall provide `strictdoc_client.py` for bidirectional mapping between `.sdoc` plain text files and SQLite DataStore records.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-INT-002
TITLE: Jira Issue Tracker Integration Client
STATEMENT: The integration layer shall provide `jira_client.py` to synchronize ticket creation, description updates, and status transitions across Jira boards.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: Med
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-INT-003
TITLE: Allure Docker Service REST Integration
STATEMENT: The integration layer shall provide `allure_client.py` to send test result payloads and trigger report generation on the Allure Docker Service.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[/SECTION]

[SECTION]
TITLE: 5. Model Abstraction & Prompt Templates

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-MDL-001
TITLE: OpenAI SDK Model Abstraction Layer
STATEMENT: All LLM requests shall route through an OpenAI Python SDK wrapper, enabling model-agnostic switching configured via environment variables (`LLM_MODEL`, `OPENAI_BASE_URL`, API key).
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-MDL-002
TITLE: Externalized Markdown Prompt System
STATEMENT: Prompt instructions (domain decomposition, GREEN-phase class repair, visual QA) shall be externalized in `backend/prompts/` as markdown templates.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[/SECTION]

[SECTION]
TITLE: 6. Shift-Left TDD & Testing Architecture

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-TST-001
TITLE: Shift-Left TDD Red-Green Lifecycle
STATEMENT: PM Studio shall enforce writing failing pytest BDD test cases (`workspace/tests/test_<REQ_ID>.py`) before dispatching developer agents to write implementation code.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-TST-002
TITLE: 5-Tier Test Architecture
STATEMENT: The system shall maintain tests categorized into Unit (`tests/unit`), API (`tests/api`), Integration (`tests/integration`), System (`tests/system`), and E2E (`tests/e2e`).
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-TST-003
TITLE: BDD Test Docstring & Allure Metadata Tagging
STATEMENT: Generated test cases shall include BDD docstrings (`Given`, `When`, `Then`) and `@allure` metadata decorators (`@allure.id`, `@allure.title`, `@allure.link`).
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[/SECTION]

[SECTION]
TITLE: 7. Application Launcher & Operations

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-OPS-001
TITLE: Cross-Platform Single Application Launcher (`run.py`)
STATEMENT: The project root shall include `run.py` to verify dependencies, launch Docker containers, start FastAPI (:8000), and start Vite dev servers (:5173).
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-OPS-002
TITLE: OS Environment & Dependency Resolution
STATEMENT: The launcher script shall automatically detect Windows vs WSL/Linux environments, resolve Python virtualenv requirements, and run `npm install` when dependencies are missing.
REQ_TYPE: Requirement
PRIORITY: High
STATUS: Backlog

[/SECTION]
